<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <script src="https://cdn.tailwindcss.com"></script>
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=DM+Sans:ital,wght@0,400;0,500;0,700;1,400;1,500;1,700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
    <style>
        html { scroll-behavior: smooth; }
        body { 
            padding-top: 0;
            padding-bottom: 50px; 
            background-color: transparent;
            font-family: 'DM Sans', sans-serif;
            position: relative;
        }
        
        /* Video background for entire site */
        .site-video-background {
            position: fixed;
            top: 0;
            left: 0;
            width: 100%;
            height: 100%;
            object-fit: cover;
            z-index: -2;
        }
        
        .site-video-overlay {
            position: fixed;
            top: 0;
            left: 0;
            width: 100%;
            height: 100%;
            background: rgba(22, 101, 52, 0.4);
            z-index: -1;
        }
        
        /* Fallback background if video fails to load */
        .site-video-background::before {
            content: '';
            position: absolute;
            top: 0;
            left: 0;
            width: 100%;
            height: 100%;
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #166534 0%, #22c55e 100%);
            z-index: -3;
        }
        
        .site-fallback-image {
            position: fixed;
            top: 0;
            left: 0;
            width: 100%;
            height: 100%;
            object-fit: cover;
            z-index: -2;
            display: none;
        }
        
        header { 
            position: fixed; 
            top: 0; 
            left: 0; 
            right: 0; 
            z-index: 10; 
            background: rgba(22, 101, 52, 0.95); 
            backdrop-filter: blur(10px); 
            box-shadow: 0 2px 4px rgba(22, 101, 52, 0.2); 
            transition: all 0.3s;
            font-family: 'DM Sans', sans-serif;
            padding: 1rem 0;
        }
        footer { 
            position: fixed; 
            bottom: 0; 
            left: 0; 
            right: 0; 
            z-index: 10;
            font-family: 'DM Sans', sans-serif;
            background-color: rgba(22, 101, 52, 0.95);
            color: white;
            padding: 1rem 0;
        }
        .fade-in { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(20px); transition: all 0.6s ease-out; }
        .fade-in.visible { opacity: 1; transform: translateY(0); }
        .card-hover { transition: transform 0.3s, box-shadow 0.3s; }
        .card-hover:hover { transform: translateY(-5px); box-shadow: 0 10px 25px rgba(0,0,0,0.15); }
        
        /* Glassmorphic backgrounds for content sections (except hero) */
        .glass-section {
            background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.15);
            backdrop-filter: blur(10px);
            border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.2);
            position: relative;
            z-index: 1;
        }
        
        /* Hero Section specific styles - no background */
        .video-hero {
            position: relative;
            overflow: hidden;
            height: 100vh;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            margin-top: 0;
            background: transparent;
        }
        
        .hero-content {
            position: relative;
            z-index: 3;
            text-align: center;
            color: white;
            max-width: 800px;
            padding: 0 20px;
        }
        
        /* Apply DM Sans font to all text elements */
        h1, h2, h3, h4, h5, h6, p, a, span, div, button, input, textarea, select {
            font-family: 'DM Sans', sans-serif;
        }
        
        /* Services Carousel Styles */
        .services-carousel-container {
            position: relative;
            overflow: hidden;
            width: 100%;
            padding: 20px 0;
        }
        
        .services-carousel-track {
            display: flex;
            transition: transform 0.5s ease;
            width: max-content;
        }
        
        .services-carousel-slide {
            flex: 0 0 auto;
            width: 320px; /* Reduced from 400px */
            margin: 0 15px;
            box-sizing: border-box;
        }
        
        /* Expertise Carousel Styles */
        .carousel-container {
            position: relative;
            overflow: hidden;
            width: 100%;
        }
        
        .carousel-track {
            display: flex;
            transition: transform 0.5s ease;
        }
        
        .carousel-slide {
            min-width: 100%;
            box-sizing: border-box;
        }
        
        .carousel-nav {
            display: flex;
            justify-content: center;
            margin-top: 20px;
        }
        
        .carousel-dot {
            width: 12px;
            height: 12px;
            border-radius: 50%;
            background-color: #cbd5e0;
            margin: 0 5px;
            cursor: pointer;
            transition: background-color 0.3s;
        }
        
        .carousel-dot.active {
            background-color: #166534;
        }
        
        .carousel-arrow {
            position: absolute;
            top: 50%;
            transform: translateY(-50%);
            background-color: rgba(22, 101, 52, 0.8);
            color: white;
            border: none;
            width: 40px;
            height: 40px;
            border-radius: 50%;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            cursor: pointer;
            z-index: 5;
            transition: background-color 0.3s;
        }
        
        .carousel-arrow:hover {
            background-color: rgba(22, 101, 52, 1);
        }
        
        .carousel-arrow.prev {
            left: 10px;
        }
        
        .carousel-arrow.next {
            right: 10px;
        }
        
        /* Icon styles for expertise section */
        .expertise-icon {
            width: 80px;
            height: 80px;
            margin: 0 auto 20px;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            background-color: rgba(220, 252, 231, 0.9);
            border-radius: 50%;
            color: #166534;
        }
        
        .expertise-icon svg {
            width: 40px;
            height: 40px;
        }
        
        /* Mobile menu styles */
        .mobile-menu {
            position: fixed;
            top: 0;
            left: 0;
            right: 0;
            bottom: 0;
            background-color: rgba(22, 101, 52, 0.98);
            z-index: 20;
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            justify-content: center;
            align-items: center;
            transform: translateY(-100%);
            transition: transform 0.3s ease;
        }
        
        .mobile-menu.active {
            transform: translateY(0);
        }
        
        .mobile-menu a {
            color: white;
            font-size: 1.5rem;
            margin: 1rem 0;
            text-decoration: none;
            font-weight: bold;
        }
        
        .close-menu {
            position: absolute;
            top: 1rem;
            right: 1rem;
            background: none;
            border: none;
            color: white;
            font-size: 2rem;
            cursor: pointer;
        }
        
        /* Updated Contact Form Styles - Reduced Size */
        #contact {
            padding-top: 2rem; /* Reduced from 3rem */
            padding-bottom: 2rem; /* Reduced from 3rem */
        }

        #contact .max-w-6xl {
            max-width: 1200px; /* Increased width for contact section */
        }

        .contact-form {
            background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.95);
            backdrop-filter: blur(10px);
            border-radius: 0.5rem; /* Reduced from 0.75rem */
            padding: 1rem; /* Reduced from 1.5rem */
            box-shadow: 0 6px 15px rgba(0,0,0,0.1); /* Reduced shadow */
            max-width: 100%;
        }

        .contact-form h3 {
            font-size: 1.25rem; /* Reduced from 1.5rem */
            margin-bottom: 0.75rem; /* Reduced spacing */
        }

        .form-input, .form-textarea {
            width: 100%;
            padding: 0.4rem 0.6rem; /* Reduced padding */
            border: 2px solid #e5e7eb;
            border-radius: 0.25rem; /* Reduced radius */
            font-size: 0.75rem; /* Smaller font size */
            transition: all 0.3s;
            background: white;
        }

        .form-input:focus, .form-textarea:focus {
            outline: none;
            border-color: #166534;
            box-shadow: 0 0 0 2px rgba(22, 101, 52, 0.1);
        }

        .form-textarea {
            min-height: 80px; /* Reduced height */
            resize: vertical;
        }

        .submit-btn {
            background: #166534;
            color: white;
            padding: 0.5rem 1rem; /* Reduced padding */
            border: none;
            border-radius: 0.25rem; /* Reduced radius */
            font-size: 0.75rem; /* Smaller font size */
            font-weight: bold;
            cursor: pointer;
            transition: all 0.3s;
            width: 100%;
        }

        .submit-btn:hover {
            background: #15803d;
            transform: translateY(-1px);
        }

        .submit-btn:disabled {
            background: #9ca3af;
            cursor: not-allowed;
            transform: none;
        }

        .alert {
            padding: 0.5rem; /* Reduced padding */
            border-radius: 0.25rem; /* Smaller radius */
            margin-bottom: 0.5rem; /* Reduced spacing */
            font-weight: 500;
            font-size: 0.75rem; /* Smaller font size */
        }

        .alert-success {
            background: #dcfce7;
            color: #166534;
            border: 1px solid #bbf7d0;
        }

        .alert-error {
            background: #fee2e2;
            color: #dc2626;
            border: 1px solid #fecaca;
        }
        
        /* Header Logo Styles - Increased size and positioned to extreme left */
        .header-logo {
            height: 70px; /* Increased from 60px */
            width: 70px; /* Added fixed width */
            margin-left: 0; /* Removed margin to push to extreme left */
        }
        
        /* Contact section layout - contact info below form */
        .contact-layout {
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
        }
        
        .contact-form-container {
            order: 1;
        }
        
        .contact-info-container {
            order: 2;
            margin-top: 2rem;
        }
        
        /* Responsive adjustments */
        @media (max-width: 768px) {
            .services-carousel-slide {
                width: 260px; /* Reduced from 300px */
            }
            
            .carousel-arrow {
                width: 35px;
                height: 35px;
            }
            
            .carousel-arrow.prev {
                left: 5px;
            }
            
            .carousel-arrow.next {
                right: 5px;
            }
            
            .expertise-icon {
                width: 60px;
                height: 60px;
            }
            
            .expertise-icon svg {
                width: 30px;
                height: 30px;
            }
            
            .contact-form {
                padding: 0.75rem; /* Further reduced padding on mobile */
            }
            
            .contact-form h3 {
                font-size: 1.125rem; /* Smaller heading on mobile */
            }
            
            .grid-cols-2 {
                grid-template-columns: 1fr !important;
                gap: 1.5rem; /* Reduced gap on mobile */
            }
            
            .header-logo {
                height: 60px; /* Increased from 50px */
                width: 60px; /* Added fixed width for mobile */
                margin-left: 0; /* Removed margin to push to extreme left */
            }
            
            .contact-info-container {
                margin-top: 1.5rem;
            }
        }
        
        @media (max-width: 640px) {
            .services-carousel-slide {
                width: 240px; /* Reduced from 280px */
            }
            
            h2 {
                font-size: 2.5rem !important;
            }
            
            .hero-content a {
                padding: 0.75rem 1.5rem;
                font-size: 0.9rem;
            }
            
            .grid-cols-3 {
                grid-template-columns: 1fr !important;
            }
            
            .grid-cols-2 {
                grid-template-columns: 1fr !important;
            }
            
            .max-w-6xl {
                padding-left: 1rem;
                padding-right: 1rem;
            }
            
            .py-20 {
                padding-top: 3rem;
                padding-bottom: 3rem;
            }
            
            .mb-16 {
                margin-bottom: 2rem;
            }
            
            .p-8 {
                padding: 1.5rem;
            }
            
            .text-xl {
                font-size: 1.125rem;
            }
            
            .text-lg {
                font-size: 1rem;
            }
            
            #contact {
                padding-top: 1.5rem;
                padding-bottom: 1.5rem;
            }
            
            .contact-form {
                padding: 0.5rem; /* Minimal padding on small screens */
            }
            
            .form-input, .form-textarea {
                padding: 0.3rem 0.5rem; /* Minimal padding */
                font-size: 0.7rem; /* Smaller font */
            }
            
            .submit-btn {
                padding: 0.4rem 0.8rem; /* Minimal padding */
                font-size: 0.7rem; /* Smaller font */
            }
            
            .header-logo {
                height: 50px; /* Increased from 45px */
                width: 50px; /* Added fixed width for mobile */
                margin-left: 0; /* Removed margin to push to extreme left */
            }
            
            .contact-info-container {
                margin-top: 1rem;
            }
        }
        
        @media (max-width: 480px) {
            .services-carousel-slide {
                width: 220px; /* Reduced from 250px */
            }
            
            h2 {
                font-size: 2rem !important;
            }
            
            .hero-content a {
                padding: 0.6rem 1.2rem;
                font-size: 0.8rem;
            }
            
            .p-8 {
                padding: 1rem;
            }
            
            .text-xl {
                font-size: 1rem;
            }
            
            .text-lg {
                font-size: 0.9rem;
            }
            
            .header-logo {
                height: 45px; /* Increased from 40px */
                width: 45px; /* Added fixed width for mobile */
                margin-left: 0; /* Removed margin to push to extreme left */
            }
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body class="font-sans">
    <!-- Site-wide Video Background -->
    <video class="site-video-background" autoplay muted loop playsinline preload="metadata" id="site-video">
        <source src="/uploads/upwil.mp4" type="video/mp4">
        <source src="./uploads/upwil.mp4" type="video/mp4">
        <source src="uploads/upwil.mp4" type="video/mp4">
        Your browser does not support the video tag.
    </video>
    
    <!-- Fallback image -->
    <img src="/uploads/envir.jpg" alt="Environmental Background" class="site-fallback-image" id="site-fallback-image">
    
    <div class="site-video-overlay"></div>

    <!-- Header -->
    <header class="bg-green-800">
        <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto pl-0 pr-4 sm:pr-6 lg:pr-8">
            <div class="flex justify-between items-center">
                <div class="flex items-center">
                    <!-- Logo added here - positioned to extreme left -->
                    <img src="\uploads\logo.jpg" class="header-logo">
                </div>
                <nav id="nav-menu" class="hidden md:flex space-x-6">
                    <a href="#home" class="text-white hover:text-green-100 transition-colors duration-300 font-bold text-base">Home</a>
                    <a href="#about" class="text-white hover:text-green-100 transition-colors duration-300 font-bold text-base">About</a>
                    <a href="#services" class="text-white hover:text-green-100 transition-colors duration-300 font-bold text-base">Services</a>
                    <a href="#expertise" class="text-white hover:text-green-100 transition-colors duration-300 font-bold text-base">Expertise</a>
                    <a href="#mission" class="text-white hover:text-green-100 transition-colors duration-300 font-bold text-base">Mission</a>
                    <a href="#contact" class="text-white hover:text-green-100 transition-colors duration-300 font-bold text-base">Contact</a>
                </nav>
                <div class="md:hidden">
                    <button id="menu-button" class="text-white hover:text-green-100 focus:outline-none transition-colors">
                        <svg class="h-5 w-5" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor">
                            <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M4 6h16M4 12h16M4 18h16"></path>
                        </svg>
                    </button>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </header>

    <!-- Mobile Menu -->
    <div id="mobile-menu" class="mobile-menu">
        <button id="close-menu" class="close-menu">
            <svg class="h-6 w-6" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor">
                <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M6 18L18 6M6 6l12 12"></path>
            </svg>
        </button>
        <a href="#home" class="text-white hover:text-green-100 transition-colors duration-300 font-bold">Home</a>
        <a href="#about" class="text-white hover:text-green-100 transition-colors duration-300 font-bold">About</a>
        <a href="#services" class="text-white hover:text-green-100 transition-colors duration-300 font-bold">Services</a>
        <a href="#expertise" class="text-white hover:text-green-100 transition-colors duration-300 font-bold">Expertise</a>
        <a href="#mission" class="text-white hover:text-green-100 transition-colors duration-300 font-bold">Mission</a>
        <a href="#contact" class="text-white hover:text-green-100 transition-colors duration-300 font-bold">Contact</a>
    </div>

    <!-- Hero Section - No background -->
    <section id="home" class="video-hero fade-in">
        <!-- Hero content -->
        
    </section>

    <!-- About Section - Glassmorphic background -->
    <section id="about" class="py-20 glass-section fade-in">
        <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-6">
            <div class="text-center mb-16">
                <h2 class="text-5xl font-bold text-center text-white mb-6">About Us</h2>
                <p class="text-xl text-white max-w-2xl mx-auto text-center">Learn more about our commitment to environmental excellence</p>
            </div>
            <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-16 items-center">
                <div>
                    <p class="text-lg text-white leading-relaxed mb-6">
                        Upwil Environmental Integrated Consultancy and Research Center Ltd is a leading environmental consultancy and research organization dedicated to providing innovative solutions for sustainable development. Our mission is to deliver high-quality services that promote environmental stewardship, social responsibility, and economic growth.
                    </p>
                    <p class="text-lg text-white leading-relaxed">
                        With years of experience in the field, we have built a reputation for excellence in environmental management, climate change adaptation, and sustainable development practices. Our team of experts is committed to making a positive impact on the environment and the communities we serve.
                    </p>
                </div>
                <div class="card-hover">
                    <img src="/uploads/pcs.webp" alt="Our Team" class="w-full rounded-xl shadow-2xl">
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Services Section with Auto-Scrolling Carousel - Glassmorphic background -->
    <section id="services" class="py-20 glass-section fade-in">
        <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-6">
            <div class="text-center mb-16">
                <h2 class="text-5xl font-bold text-center text-white mb-6">Our Services</h2>
                <p class="text-xl text-white max-w-2xl mx-auto text-center">Comprehensive environmental solutions tailored to your needs</p>
            </div>
            
            <div class="services-carousel-container">
                <div class="services-carousel-track" id="services-track">
                    <!-- Service cards that will be continuously rotated -->
                    <div class="services-carousel-slide">
                        <div class="bg-white p-8 rounded-2xl shadow-lg card-hover h-full">
                            <img src="/uploads/envir.jpg" alt="EIA" class="w-full h-48 object-cover rounded-xl mb-6">
                            <h3 class="font-bold text-2xl text-green-700 mb-4">Environmental Impact Assessments (EIA)</h3>
                            <p class="text-gray-600 leading-relaxed">Identifying and mitigating potential environmental impacts of development projects to ensure sustainable growth.</p>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="services-carousel-slide">
                        <div class="bg-white p-8 rounded-2xl shadow-lg card-hover h-full">
                            <img src="/uploads/ugg.jpg" alt="Sustainability Consulting" class="w-full h-48 object-cover rounded-xl mb-6">
                            <h3 class="font-bold text-2xl text-green-700 mb-4">Sustainability Consulting</h3>
                            <p class="text-gray-600 leading-relaxed">Developing strategies for sustainable development and implementing environmentally friendly practices across industries.</p>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="services-carousel-slide">
                        <div class="bg-white p-8 rounded-2xl shadow-lg card-hover h-full">
                            <img src="/uploads/reas.jpg" alt="Research and Development" class="w-full h-48 object-cover rounded-xl mb-6">
                            <h3 class="font-bold text-2xl text-green-700 mb-4">Research and Development</h3>
                            <p class="text-gray-600 leading-relaxed">Conducting cutting-edge research on environmental issues and developing innovative solutions for a greener future.</p>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="services-carousel-slide">
                        <div class="bg-white p-8 rounded-2xl shadow-lg card-hover h-full">
                            <img src="/uploads/cons.webp" alt="Capacity Building" class="w-full h-48 object-cover rounded-xl mb-6">
                            <h3 class="font-bold text-2xl text-green-700 mb-4">Capacity Building and Training</h3>
                            <p class="text-gray-600 leading-relaxed">Providing comprehensive training and capacity-building programs for organizations and individuals to foster environmental awareness.</p>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Expertise Section with Icon Carousel - Glassmorphic background -->
    <section id="expertise" class="py-20 glass-section fade-in">
        <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-6">
            <div class="text-center mb-16">
                <h2 class="text-5xl font-bold text-center text-white mb-6">Our Expertise</h2>
                <p class="text-xl text-white max-w-2xl mx-auto text-center">Areas where we excel in delivering exceptional environmental solutions</p>
            </div>
            
            <div class="carousel-container">
                <button class="carousel-arrow prev" id="expertise-prev">
                    <svg class="w-6 h-6" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
                        <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M15 19l-7-7 7-7"></path>
                    </svg>
                </button>
                
                <div class="carousel-track" id="expertise-track">
                    <!-- Slide 1 -->
                    <div class="carousel-slide">
                        <div class="grid md:grid-cols-3 gap-10">
                            <div class="bg-white p-8 rounded-2xl shadow-lg card-hover text-center">
                                <div class="expertise-icon">
                                    <svg fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
                                        <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M9 12l2 2 4-4m5.618-4.016A11.955 11.955 0 0112 2.944a11.955 11.955 0 01-8.618 3.04A12.02 12.02 0 003 9c0 5.591 3.824 10.29 9 11.622 5.176-1.332 9-6.03 9-11.622 0-1.042-.133-2.052-.382-3.016z"></path>
                                    </svg>
                                </div>
                                <h3 class="font-bold text-2xl text-green-700 mb-4">Environmental Management</h3>
                                <p class="text-gray-600 leading-relaxed">Developing and implementing comprehensive environmental management systems and strategies to ensure compliance and sustainability.</p>
                            </div>
                            <div class="bg-white p-8 rounded-2xl shadow-lg card-hover text-center">
                                <div class="expertise-icon">
                                    <svg fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
                                        <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M3 15a4 4 0 004 4h9a5 5 0 10-.1-9.999 5.002 5.002 0 10-9.78 2.096A4.001 4.001 0 003 15z"></path>
                                    </svg>
                                </div>
                                <h3 class="font-bold text-2xl text-green-700 mb-4">Climate Change</h3>
                                <p class="text-gray-600 leading-relaxed">Conducting detailed climate change vulnerability assessments and developing effective adaptation strategies for resilient communities.</p>
                            </div>
                            <div class="bg-white p-8 rounded-2xl shadow-lg card-hover text-center">
                                <div class="expertise-icon">
                                    <svg fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
                                        <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M21 12a9 9 0 01-9 9m9-9a9 9 0 00-9-9m9 9H3m9 9v-9m0-9v9"></path>
                                    </svg>
                                </div>
                                <h3 class="font-bold text-2xl text-green-700 mb-4">Sustainable Development</h3>
                                <p class="text-gray-600 leading-relaxed">Promoting sustainable development practices and seamlessly integrating environmental considerations into all development projects.</p>
                            </div>
                        </div>
